{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000036"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "it was like the beginning of the social media. So now, you probably hear about Dubai from each and every refrigerator.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000036"}], "text": "The beginning of social media increased Dubai's international presence, impacting population interest."}, "title": "Social Media Influence", "topic": "Dubai Property Market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:67f0bdeb4743c6cb", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Social Media Influence", "topic": "Dubai Property Market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000046"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "demand on the townhouses and villas increased significantly for the ready properties uh after Corona.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000046"}], "text": "Demand for townhouses and villas increased significantly for ready properties after Corona."}, "title": "Post-Corona Demand Shift", "topic": "Dubai Property Market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:177129de4494e37f", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Post-Corona Demand Shift", "topic": "Dubai Property Market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "it took us almost three years to drop forty percent in price.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"}], "text": "A previous market took almost three years to drop forty percent in price."}, "title": "Price Drop Timeline", "topic": "Dubai Property Market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:b89ec5764401a696", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Price Drop Timeline", "topic": "Dubai Property Market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000050"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "it's way more appealing to get the free two years, four years payment plan rather than try to get a mortgage or trying to get some sort of a cheaper unit on the secondary market.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000050"}], "text": "Developers' free years payment plans appeal more to international investors than secondary market options."}, "title": "Payment Plans Appeal", "topic": "Dubai Property Market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:f8912a2bdb39138f", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Payment Plans Appeal", "topic": "Dubai Property Market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So that most probably the seller before at least, uh, he could say, no, you know what? I'm still wanting this.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"}], "text": "If bank valuation is lower than the asking price, sellers may still hold to their price, unlike UK norms."}, "title": "Bank Valuation Impact", "topic": "Dubai Property Market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:eceb148ba1e1a43b", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Bank Valuation Impact", "topic": "Dubai Property Market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000035"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "I see Dubai real estate from the government regulation side as a hot stove. So, when the market needs to be, let's say, increased, they push the the heater up", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000035"}], "text": "The Dubai real estate market is compared to a hot stove, implying that government regulations adjust the market conditions like turning up heat."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Analogy in Market Regulation", "topic": "Dubai Property Market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:expression:ece1c7d379afaf86", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Analogy in Market Regulation", "topic": "Dubai Property Market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "it took us almost three years to drop forty percent in price. So if you're looking for the whole market to go down to to forty percent, that probably not going to happen within one or two or three or even or even twelve months altogether.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000048"}], "text": "A comparison is made between historical market cycles to illustrate potential future market behaviors, using a timeline reference and percentage change as markers."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Historical Comparison of Real Estate Dynamics", "topic": "Dubai Property Market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:expression:880bc3ae442be392", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Historical Comparison of Real Estate Dynamics", "topic": "Dubai Property Market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "That's not the case in Dubai. That's not. So that most probably the seller before at least, uh, he could say, no, you know what? I'm still wanting this.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"}], "text": "In Dubai, a seller may not lower the property price even if the bank's evaluation suggests a lower price."}, "title": "Property Sale Constraints in Dubai", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:61794d02cc24d3a6", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Property Sale Constraints in Dubai", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000055"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "under supply of the villas and townhouses so demand of those who are even living in Dubai majority of the and and moving to Dubai from let's say US", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000055"}], "text": "There is an undersupply of villas and townhouses in Dubai, which pushes their prices higher."}, "title": "Demand for Villas and Townhouses", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:e3f8be03f0a9fbd5", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Demand for Villas and Townhouses", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000057"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you can see uh two thousand two hundred twenty eight apartment being transferred meaning someone sold someone purchased and for villas and townhouses because there is quite a big quantity of that as well in Dubai South is thirty two you can see thirty two here so let me go back to the apartments overall out of the Dubai total number of transactions is twenty six percent", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000057"}], "text": "In Dubai South, 2,228 apartments and 32 villas and townhouses have been transferred, making up 26% of Dubai's total transactions."}, "title": "Dubai South Property Transactions", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:7269f0455d1ba7c5", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Dubai South Property Transactions", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000062"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you cannot really extremely push the rental price up because of the Dubai rental index", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000062"}], "text": "It is difficult to significantly increase rental prices due to the Dubai rental index."}, "title": "Impact of the Dubai Rental Index", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:e7161b7d5cb9702f", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Impact of the Dubai Rental Index", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000068"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "A C, uh Downtown, even Jumeirah Village Circle, they had a lot of units which were on their short term rental. So now all these units which are furnished, not really suitable for um a long term tenant in Dubai because usually people have the furniture themselves.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000068"}], "text": "Furnished units not suitable for long-term tenants in Dubai are being put on the market, creating a surplus due to service fees being paid while units are empty."}, "title": "Market Trend of Short-term Rentals", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:knowledge:44abcea8aaeff6e0", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Market Trend of Short-term Rentals", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053", "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000054"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "If the evaluation is coming from the bank with a lower price", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"}], "text": "The bank's evaluation is lower."}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": {"citations": [{"quote": "the properties, um the good ones are on a high demand always.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000054"}], "text": "Properties, especially good ones, are in high demand."}, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "That's not the case in Dubai. That's not. So that most probably the seller before at least, uh, he could say, no, you know what? I'm still wanting this.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:u000053"}], "text": "In Dubai, sellers may still demand prices higher than the bank's valuation."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Price vs Bank Evaluation", "topic": "Dubai property market"}, "content_hash": "0cf66d41b7292dcc43c7b993fdf0db8d152c99e84ab40ab1d894f66a3fb7672e", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646:cases:90b501098e970a68", "metadata_hash": "5db944ab267950f86baf2f992df5110a4d3e6e8ae329ab5a6fe11fdf40f4c0e6", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-07-01", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "5d9d8d2747f40eed45f7a35dd4cee40a350a4b34325df23947207f4125a4d5e2", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-07-01-the-dubai-property-market-update-demand-price-drops-what-s-c-7689113646", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDFBhoTYVPk", "title": "Price vs Bank Evaluation", "topic": "Dubai property market", "topic_slug": "dubai-property-market"}
